Revision history for MCP-Picnic

0.001     2026-09-18 19:29:01Z
    - Initial release
    - MCP server exposing the Picnic Supermarket API (via WWW::Picnic)
      to AI assistants such as Claude
    - Interactive 2FA login flow
    - Tools: search_products, get_product_details, get_suggestions,
      get_cart, add_to_cart, remove_from_cart, clear_cart,
      get_delivery_slots, set_delivery_slot, get_user, get_categories
    - HTTP server variant (mcp-picnic-http) for remote MCP and a REST API
